      "id": 21666,
      "name": "Adam",
      "username": "Adam",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/adam/{size}/1946_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-21T19:32:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’d think the best time would be if you played a long game and got Voss to cycle his deck, then it popped with no minions. That extremely unlikely situation aside, turn 1 is still probably the best time for it. everyone’s still at full HP, so they can survive that amount of damage. It’s never pleasant, but it’s better then than when there are 400 minions in the trash. (Note: I’ve modified my deck to include nearly 500 minions. It’s incredibly hard.)</p>",
